flowchart TD
    Start[Load Menu Config/HTML] --> ParseHTML[HtmlParser.Parse]
    ParseHTML --> BuildDOM[Build Element Tree]
    BuildDOM --> ParseCSS[CssParser.Apply]
    ParseCSS --> RegisterHooks[Detect data-hook, Subscribe to EventBus]
    RegisterHooks --> SetupInputs[Via IControlContext]
    SetupInputs --> UpdateLoop[MenuSystem.Update: Handle Events/JS]
    UpdateLoop --> RenderLoop[MenuSystem.Render: Draw Elements via IRenderContext]
    RenderLoop --> UserInteract[Input Event]
    UserInteract --> PublishEvent[EventBus.Publish]
    PublishEvent --> InvokeHook[Call Backend Method]
    InvokeHook --> UpdateDOM[Modify Elements/Styles]
    UpdateDOM --> RenderLoop